<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>文化推廣工作坊報名｜Young Young 都來街頭玩</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary-color: #1a365d;
      --accent-color: #e53e3e;
      --bg-color: #f7fafc;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --border-color: #e2e8f0;
      --text-color: #2d3748;
      --text-muted: #718096;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      color: var(--text-color);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 20px 10px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 10px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .header .subtitle {
      color: var(--accent-color);
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      color: var(--primary-color);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .header p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #feb2b2;
      color: #9b2c2c;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .section {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--primary-color);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .workshop-item {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      padding-bottom: 15px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-color);
    }

    .workshop-item:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      padding-bottom: 0;
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .workshop-time {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #2b6cb0;
    }

    .workshop-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .notice {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #c53030;
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: var(--text-color);
    }

    .form-group label .required {
      color: var(--accent-color);
      margin-left: 4px;
    }

    .form-control {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .form-control:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #3182ce;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(66, 153, 225, 0.2);
    }

    .radio-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .radio-label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }

    .radio-label:hover {
      background-color: #edf2f7;
    }

    .radio-label input {
      margin-right: 10px;
    }

    .radio-info {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      width: 100%;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .remaining {
      color: var(--accent-color);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .submit-btn {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #3182ce;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .submit-btn:hover {
      background-color: #2b6cb0;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #3182ce;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .footer a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container {
        padding: 15px;
      }
      
      .radio-info {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <header class="header">
      <div class="subtitle">新北文化大使 ✕ Young Young 都來街頭玩</div>
      <h1>文化推廣工作坊報名</h1>
      <p>填寫以下資料完成報名，錄取資訊將寄至你填寫的 Email</p>
      <span class="badge">開放報名中</span>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">10/17（六）府中非常熱區｜三場文化推廣工作坊</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        這次帶大家從不同地方特色出發，透過手作體驗認識坪林、林口與淡水的地方文化。三場工作坊各有不同主題，從茶葉拓印、地方明信片，到具有淡水特色的頭旗設計，讓地方故事變成可以帶回家的創意作品！
      </p>

      <div class="workshop-item">
        <div class="workshop-time">🕓 16:00－17:00｜坪林 × 茶葉拓印體驗</div>
        <div class="workshop-desc">運用坪林茶葉的特色進行拓印創作，透過簡單有趣的手作方式，感受茶鄉文化。</div>
      </div>

      <div class="workshop-item">
        <div class="workshop-time">🕔 17:00－18:00｜林口 × 手作地方明信片</div>
        <div class="workshop-desc">以林口的地方特色為靈感，設計一張屬於自己的地方明信片，把街區記憶帶回家。</div>
      </div>

      <div class="workshop-item">
        <div class="workshop-time">🕕 18:00－19:30｜淡水 × 頭旗明信片</div>
        <div class="workshop-desc">認識淡水獨具特色的頭旗文化，將傳統元素融入明信片創作，打造一張專屬於淡水的紀念作品。</div>
      </div>

      <div class="notice">
        📌 每場正取 16 人、備取 4 人<br>
        ⚠️ 名額有限，額滿即關閉報名！
      </div>
    </section>

    <form id="registrationForm">
      <h2 class="section-title">填寫報名資料</h2>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="fullname">姓名<span class="required">*</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="fullname" name="fullname" class="form-control" required placeholder="請輸入姓名">
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="email">Email<span class="required">*</span></label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" class="form-control" required placeholder="example@email.com">
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="phone">手機號碼<span class="required">*</span></label>
        <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" class="form-control" required placeholder="0912345678">
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="grade">年級／身份<span class="required">*</span></label>
        <select id="grade" name="grade" class="form-control" required>
          <option value="" disabled selected>(請選擇)</option>
          <option value="國小">國小</option>
          <option value="國中">國中</option>
          <option value="高中職一年級">高中職一年級</option>
          <option value="高中職二年級">高中職二年級</option>
          <option value="高中職三年級">高中職三年級</option>
          <option value="大學一年級">大學一年級</option>
          <option value="大學二年級">大學二年級</option>
          <option value="大學三年級">大學三年級</option>
          <option value="大學四年級">大學四年級</option>
          <option value="研究生">研究生</option>
          <option value="社會人士">社會人士</option>
          <option value="其他">其他</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="nationality">國籍<span class="required">*</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="nationality" name="nationality" class="form-control" required placeholder="例：台灣">
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="gender">性別<span class="required">*</span></label>
        <select id="gender" name="gender" class="form-control" required>
          <option value="" disabled selected>(請選擇)</option>
          <option value="女">女</option>
          <option value="男">男</option>
          <option value="其他">其他</option>
          <option value="不願透露">不願透露</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="age">年齡區間<span class="required">*</span></label>
        <select id="age" name="age" class="form-control" required>
          <option value="" disabled selected>(請選擇)</option>
          <option value="12歲以下">12歲以下</option>
          <option value="13–15歲">13–15歲</option>
          <option value="16–18歲">16–18歲</option>
          <option value="19–22歲">19–22歲</option>
          <option value="23–29歲">23–29歲</option>
          <option value="30–39歲">30–39歲</option>
          <option value="40–49歲">40–49歲</option>
          <option value="50歲以上">50歲以上</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>參與場次（三選一）<span class="required">*</span></label>
        <div class="radio-group">
          <label class="radio-label">
            <input type="radio" name="session" value="C01" required>
            <div class="radio-info">
              <span><strong>C01 坪林｜茶葉拓印</strong> 10/17（六）16:00–17:00</span>
              <span class="remaining">正取剩 16 位</span>
            </div>
          </label>

          <label class="radio-label">
            <input type="radio" name="session" value="C02">
            <div class="radio-info">
              <span><strong>C02 林口｜手作地方明信片</strong> 10/17（六）17:00–18:00</span>
              <span class="remaining">正取剩 16 位</span>
            </div>
          </label>

          <label class="radio-label">
            <input type="radio" name="session" value="C03">
            <div class="radio-info">
              <span><strong>C03 淡水｜頭旗明信片</strong> 10/17（六）18:00–19:30</span>
              <span class="remaining">正取剩 16 位</span>
            </div>
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">送出報名 🎉</button>
      <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;">
        所有欄位均為必填。額滿的場次將自動關閉選項。
      </p>
    </form>

    <footer class="footer">
      <p>新北市國際青年文化交流計畫</p>
      <p>📧 聯絡我們：<a href="mailto:ntpcca@wceo.org">ntpcca@wceo.org</a></p>
      <p>📱 IG 看更多：<a href="https://www.instagram.com/ntpcyouthculture/" target="_blank">@ntpcyouthculture</a></p>
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
